foration depth. Total 6 passes performed.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T07:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-03T08:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3741</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed final up pass and placed CCL at 3729,7 m with top shot at 3733 m. Lined up for fireing guns through Altus safe sub. Perforated interval 3733 - 3742,6 m. Tenson dropped 100 lbs as the guns were detonaited. Observed approx 2 bar drop on DHPG. WHP 82,7 bar. Pulled slowly out of hole after perforation.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T08:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-03T10:20:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH with perforation string from 3660 m to surface. WHP 85 bar.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T10:20:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-03T12:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Closed SV and HMV and inflow tested same. Purged lubricator with N2.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T12:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-03T12:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held toolbox talk prior to L/D tractor and perforation guns.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T12:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-03T13:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Broke lubricator and laid down tractor and perforating guns.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T13:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-03T14:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Redressed tractor and Halliburton firing head.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T14:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-03T16:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Observed one strand at the 7/16&quot; cable almost broken. Unspooled 1450 m of cable to get cable within acceptable condition.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T16:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-03T18:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Re built cable head and tested same. 100% WP.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T18:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-03T18:10:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held toolbox talk for installing BHA #4.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T18:10:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-03T21:05:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Lifted tractor and installed same into lubricator. Installed perforation guns into lubricator. Connected firing head. Filled riser with 120 litre 50/50 MEG/RX-72. Stabbed lubricator and leak tested QTS to 20/345 bar for 5/10 min. Opened HMV. WHP 92 bar. Equalized across SV via Kill wing and opened SV.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T21:05:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-03T21:20:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">500</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH w/BHA #4 tractor and short perforation gun from surface to 500 m. Stopped for correlating across DHSV.
Meanwhile held Debrief of previous correlation pass.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T21:20:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-03T21:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">500</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Halliburton performed communication check and correlated depth across DHSV.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-12-03T21:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-12-04T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2900</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- perforate</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Continued to RIH from 500 to 2900 m. WHP 92 bar.
